  {
   "id": "fbp_4161",
   "author_id": "fb_u_helenliu_naperville_086f91",
   "message": "My last two weeks at DuPage Riverside start Monday! I cleaned out my top drawer today and found the name badge from my very first week. 31 years of wonderful patients and the best outpatient pharmacy team anyone could ask for. I am going to miss you all 😊❤️",
   "created_at": "2026-10-30T23:45:37Z",
   "visibility": "friends",
   "page_id": null,
   "group_id": null
  },
  {
   "id": "fbp_4162",
   "author_id": "fbu_1201",
   "message": "heads up fam 🙃 mom just posted about her last 2 weeks at work. go ahead and congratulate her on it but nothing about the 12th, the tavern or aunt lily flying in. she reads every single comment lol",
   "created_at": "2026-10-31T00:12:48Z",
   "visibility": "group",
   "page_id": null,
   "group_id": "fbgr_351"
  },
  {
   "id": "fbp_4351",
   "author_id": "fbu_1201",
   "message": "ok everyone welcome!! this group is hidden so mom cant see it. her last day at dupage riverside is thurs 11/12 and we're surprising her that night at bellwether tavern in naperville, 7:30. she thinks its a quiet dinner w dad, gracie and me lol. please dont post about it on her page. grace and i are the admins, message either of us",
   "created_at": "2026-09-29T01:04:37Z",
   "visibility": "group",
   "page_id": null,
   "group_id": "fbgr_351"
  },
  {
   "id": "fbp_4352",
   "author_id": "fbu_1203",
   "message": "Count me in! Booking my flight from San Jose this week. My big sister is going to cry and I cannot wait.",
   "created_at": "2026-09-30T02:12:51Z",
   "visibility": "group",
   "page_id": null,
   "group_id": "fbgr_351"
  },
  {
   "id": "fbp_4353",
   "author_id": "fbu_1209",
   "message": "The outpatient pharmacy crew is in. Anita, Gloria, Rachel and I will be there, and we'll make sure she actually leaves on time that day.",
   "created_at": "2026-10-01T18:22:09Z",
   "visibility": "group",
   "page_id": null,
   "group_id": "fbgr_351"
  },
  {
   "id": "fbp_4354",
   "author_id": "fbu_1201",
   "message": "photo request!! im making a memory board for the party. send me any old pics of mom, work, trips, the 80s, anything lol. message me or post here by 10/25. thank u!!",
   "created_at": "2026-10-11T01:30:44Z",
   "visibility": "group",
   "page_id": null,
   "group_id": "fbgr_351"
  },
  {
   "id": "fbp_4355",
   "author_id": "fbu_1214",
   "message": "Kevin, I just messaged you the one from the 2009 block party when Helen's apple pie beat everyone on the street 😄",
   "created_at": "2026-10-11T15:05:38Z",
   "visibility": "group",
   "page_id": null,
   "group_id": "fbgr_351"
  },
  {
   "id": "fbp_4356",
   "author_id": "fbu_1216",
   "message": "Tuesday mahjong is coming! Linda, May and I promise not to say a word at the table this week.",
   "created_at": "2026-10-15T00:40:17Z",
   "visibility": "group",
   "page_id": null,
   "group_id": "fbgr_351"
  },
